        "title": {
          "en": "Session Editing",
          "zh": "会话编辑装配"
        },
        "description": {
          "en": "dsh profile bundle: assembles @morlay/session-branch, @morlay/session-rdb, @morlay/ui-conversation-message-actions, @morlay/ui-conversation-manager and @morlay/dsh-reference into a web profile — the rewind / retry / recall / fork closed loop on RDB persistence; the conversation shell stays on the official ui-conversation row and our extensions only register on its slots.",
          "zh": "profile 聚合 bundle：把 @morlay/session-branch、@morlay/session-rdb、@morlay/ui-conversation-message-actions、@morlay/ui-conversation-manager 与 @morlay/dsh-reference 装进 web profile，提供就地编辑 / 重试 / 撤回 / 分支（rewind / retry / recall / fork）闭环；对话外壳走官方 ui-conversation 行，扩展只注册在它的槽位上。"
        },
        "repository": {
